///▙▖▙▖▞▞▙▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂▂ ::[0xA4]::
// ▛//▞▞ ⟦⎊⟧ :: ⧗-25.131 // COMPILE-RUN.BUN :: Build Script ▞▞
// ▛▞// Build.Runner :: ρ{Input}.φ{Bind}.τ{Output} ▹
// //▞⋮⋮ ⟦📦⟧ :: [build] [compile] [run] [vec3boot] [⊢ ⇨ ⟿ ▷]
// ⫸ 〔runtime.build.context〕

import { $ } from "bun";

console.log("Building Vec3Boot boot project (workspace)...");
await $`cargo build --release`;

console.log("Running vec3-boot executable...");
const args = process.argv.slice(2);
if (args.length > 0) {
  await $`./target/release/vec3-boot ${args.join(' ')}`;
} else {
  await $`./target/release/vec3-boot`;
}

// :: ∎
